{"id":"ba4c98699a906790","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md","title":"ZFC Recursion3 Arithmetical Hierarchy Level","display":"df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level — ZFC Recursion3 Arithmetical Hierarchy Level","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level — ZFC Recursion3 Arithmetical Hierarchy Level","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level — ZFC Recursion3 Arithmetical Hierarchy Level"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"243e4a6577a71cc8\" href=\"?note=243e4a6577a71cc8\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(n,\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the predicates from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li>Ordered pairs of natural numbers use the fixed canonical pairing function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level}\n\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S(n,\\Gamma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(H,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\omega))^3\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal D=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)\\}\n\\land H(0)=\\langle\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Sigma_m,\\Pi_m,\\Delta_m,\n\\Sigma_{m+1},\\Pi_{m+1},\\Delta_{m+1}\\;\\Bigl(\nH(m)=\\langle\\Sigma_m,\\Pi_m,\\Delta_m\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\Sigma_{m+1}=\\Bigl\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\exists B\\in\\Pi_m\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\Pi_{m+1}=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\omega\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma_{m+1}\\}\n\\land\\Delta_{m+1}=\\Sigma_{m+1}\\cap\\Pi_{m+1}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land H(m+1)=\\langle\\Sigma_{m+1},\\Pi_{m+1},\\Delta_{m+1}\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,\\Delta_n\\;\\bigl(\nH(n)=\\langle\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,\\Delta_n\\rangle\n\\land\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,\\Delta_n\\}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level}\n\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S(n,\\Gamma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(H,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\omega))^3\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal D=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)\\}\n\\land H(0)=\\langle\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Sigma_m,\\Pi_m,\\Delta_m,\n\\Sigma_{m+1},\\Pi_{m+1},\\Delta_{m+1}\\;\\Bigl(\nH(m)=\\langle\\Sigma_m,\\Pi_m,\\Delta_m\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\Sigma_{m+1}=\\Bigl\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\exists B\\in\\Pi_m\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\Pi_{m+1}=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\omega\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma_{m+1}\\}\n\\land\\Delta_{m+1}=\\Sigma_{m+1}\\cap\\Pi_{m+1}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land H(m+1)=\\langle\\Sigma_{m+1},\\Pi_{m+1},\\Delta_{m+1}\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,\\Delta_n\\;\\bigl(\nH(n)=\\langle\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,\\Delta_n\\rangle\n\\land\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,\\Delta_n\\}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The lightface hierarchy is constructed inside the assertion; the symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_n\">\\(\\Sigma^0_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_n\">\\(\\Pi^0_n\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^0_n\">\\(\\Delta^0_n\\)</span> are no longer undeclared parameters.</li>\n<li>The base level is the decidable subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>; successor existential projection and complement generate the usual finite arithmetical hierarchy.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"243e4a6577a71cc8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n,\\Gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:\\omega^2\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level}\n\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S(n,\\Gamma)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(H,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\omega))^3\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal D=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)\\}\n\\land H(0)=\\langle\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Sigma_m,\\Pi_m,\\Delta_m,\n\\Sigma_{m+1},\\Pi_{m+1},\\Delta_{m+1}\\;\\Bigl(\nH(m)=\\langle\\Sigma_m,\\Pi_m,\\Delta_m\\rangle\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\n\\Sigma_{m+1}=\\Bigl\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\exists B\\in\\Pi_m\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\n\\Pi_{m+1}=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\omega\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma_{m+1}\\}\n\\land\\Delta_{m+1}=\\Sigma_{m+1}\\cap\\Pi_{m+1}\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land H(m+1)=\\langle\\Sigma_{m+1},\\Pi_{m+1},\\Delta_{m+1}\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,\\Delta_n\\;\\bigl(\nH(n)=\\langle\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,\\Delta_n\\rangle\n\\land\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,\\Delta_n\\}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta^0_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2392,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c405a6e3532b689","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3ArithmeticalHierarchyLevel}_S$ (lightface hierarchy-level predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level.md|58-df-zfc-recursion3-arithmetical-hierarchy-level]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","243e4a6577a71cc8","36d7463d215be751"]}